    "long_instructions": "### **Generate with AI**\r\n\r\n#### **Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. Highlight `progressBar.style.width = progress + \"%\"` and select **Add to AI Tutor Chat**. Ask the AI to explain what this code does.\r\n\r\n2. Highlight the event handler and select **Add to AI Tutor Chat**. Prompt the AI to refactor the event handler into a **named arrow function**.\r\n\r\n3. Click the **Increase Progress** button and check that it still works as expected.\r\n\r\n4. **Check Code:** Look for where the code:\r\n\r\n   * defines a **named function**\r\n   * uses **arrow function syntax**\r\n   * uses the function name as the event handler in `addEventListener`\r\n",
